# Shell scripts are bind-mounted into Linux containers and run by busybox sh,
# which treats a trailing CR as part of the command. A checkout that converted
# them to CRLF -- git's default on Windows, which this stack supports -- would
# produce "not found" errors naming a command that is plainly there.
*.sh text eol=lf
